    <!-- Settings -->
    <string name="settings_help_title">Help</string>
    <string name="settings_help_content"><b>Focus Score Guide</b>\n\nYour Focus Score is calculated based on how you spend your time. Apps are categorized to weigh their impact:\n\n• <b>Productive (0.2x):</b> These apps have minimal negative impact. Ideal for work or learning.\n• <b>Neutral (1.0x):</b> Standard impact on your score.\n• <b>Distracting (2.0x):</b> These apps penalize your score twice as much. Use these mindfully.\n\n<b>Goal:</b> Keep your daily score above your target to maintain digital wellness.</string>
